    "note": "'Amended' text dated Apr. 8, 2021 (House passed Apr. 7, 2021, 69-47); the text read is not confirmed as the enrolled one and later amendments are not in the text read. Struck: the long list of old 16-23-20 exceptions (officers, military, hunters, home, vehicle storage rules, etc.), the old 23-31-215(M) list of ten prohibited places (replaced by a cross-reference to 16-23-20(A)), the permit-card carry rule in 23-31-215(K), the permit-expiry fine in (U), and the permit-holder limits in 16-23-420(A), 16-23-430(B), 16-23-465. Item (11) violations are charged only as trespass under 16-11-620 (Section 4 excludes them from the 16-23-50 penalty). The 16-23-20(A) text is quoted as one sentence plus its item list."
